{"w":2400,"lines":[{"t":"Audioscripts","x":0.083044981179504263,"h":0.015988371937820545,"y":0.059593023315650417,"w":0.10726643880208334,"c":1},{"y":0.10601819486309105,"x":0.084775079978726312,"w":0.6211072794596354,"t":"Firstly, there's an exhibition showing the history of the mine, with many original black and","h":0.017528317039708585,"c":1},{"t":"white photos. To see that, you go from the car park, via a covered walkway to the Main","y":0.12209302332957195,"w":0.60726643880208331,"c":1,"x":0.083044981259808096,"h":0.016115514276076048},{"y":0.13808139522658391,"w":0.60380620320638023,"x":0.083044994568955227,"c":1,"h":0.015988371937820545,"t":"Visitor Centre. Go through the ticket office to an area where there are lockers to leave"},{"c":1,"t":"heavy bags in, and where you can borrow raincoats. Beyond that room is the exhibition.","y":0.15335849610591212,"w":0.61254786173502607,"x":0.082993824882882969,"h":0.018085569164150606},{"w":0.64013839721679688,"h":0.014534884186538477,"y":0.17877906953251277,"t":"There's a small bathhouse where miners used to wash after their shift underground. You can","c":1,"x":0.083044988149731006},{"t":"see that in the building directly to the north of the engine house. The boiler has gone from","y":0.19314205726935629,"x":0.083044990795779886,"w":0.63321797688802084,"h":0.016160268229650776,"c":1},{"x":0.084728096193388794,"h":0.014962134284519313,"t":"there now, but there are lines of tin baths on the stone floor.","y":0.2091643626876305,"w":0.42049438476562501,"c":1},{"y":0.23401162798214825,"x":0.084775090736090603,"t":"There's a display of early mining tools from the days before mechanisation. You can find","c":1,"w":0.60899653116861985,"h":0.015988371937820545},{"h":0.018143434971675254,"t":"that in a small L-shaped building in the middle of the northern boundary of the site. It's","y":0.24850145503692023,"w":0.60736241658528645,"c":1,"x":0.082998262809620374},{"x":0.084775081848214931,"h":0.013296011196641033,"y":0.26592022421014105,"w":0.59861592610677083,"c":1,"t":"incredible to think how miners were able to use hand implements to cut through rock."},{"h":0.014534884186538477,"t":"The vehicle shed, where you can find wagons of different sizes, along with some of the","x":0.08650519137466807,"w":0.60034601847330726,"c":1,"y":0.289244185811393},{"t":"hi-tech cutting machines that were in use until the mine closed, is in the southwest corner of","y":0.30510846776742984,"c":1,"x":0.086505195791279216,"w":0.64013839721679688,"h":0.01611246238478925},{"t":"the site, and can be accessed via a covered walkway.","y":0.31980005654495214,"h":0.017474159149960089,"w":0.37041280110677088,"x":0.08296903506279743,"c":1},{"x":0.084775074183507548,"w":0.61937718709309908,"h":0.015988371937820545,"t":"There is a field with ponies, which are always popular with children, on the north-eastern","y":0.3444767442609471,"c":1},{"t":"boundary of the site, not approached via a covered walkway.","c":1,"y":0.36039188230614183,"x":0.083044971263986245,"w":0.42733566284179691,"h":0.016095171448565537},{"y":0.38372092994592566,"t":"The other building to mention is the education centre. This is where school groups go when","w":0.64013839721679688,"c":1,"x":0.083044988320667368,"h":0.017608671275112897},{"c":1,"x":0.083044983084244517,"h":0.017571036844006627,"w":0.63840830485026046,"t":"they visit the mine, but it's also accessible to the public as it contains a library and small gift","y":0.39958012620577477},{"c":1,"x":0.083003853262620067,"y":0.4142268832931113,"h":0.018947335704379009,"w":0.6194697062174479,"t":"shop. The centre is connected to the ticket office via a short section of covered walkway."},{"t":"PART 3","x":0.084687885030132928,"h":0.016666912215001162,"c":1,"y":0.47495142708431293,"w":0.086679592132568359},{"y":0.5070929109090847,"t":"TUTOR:","h":0.010523480414676878,"c":1,"w":0.045092973709106449,"x":0.084719949146824375},{"w":0.041522490183512381,"h":0.0087209305119231306,"x":0.0865051908078978,"t":"NADIA:","y":0.55523255798168369,"c":1},{"c":1,"h":0.0093585555581799929,"x":0.08469919041247391,"t":"FERGUS:","y":0.60287886174128424,"w":0.050324802398681659},{"x":0.086424465886359561,"y":0.63348375000144364,"w":0.041683940887451157,"t":"NADIA:","c":1,"h":0.010648778804621561},{"w":0.052069358825683601,"h":0.012162146491550563,"c":1,"t":"FERGUS:","y":0.6654305545417204,"x":0.082961860689242453},{"h":0.011627907349230693,"w":0.043252595265706364,"c":1,"t":"NADIA:","y":0.71366279048720638,"x":0.084775086367290989},{"w":0.050426626205444344,"t":"FERGUS:","y":0.74524138933283224,"x":0.084648278505837907,"h":0.012424198041185774,"c":1},{"x":0.084775085725703789,"h":0.011627907349230804,"c":1,"y":0.79360465095418609,"w":0.044982700347900403,"t":"TUTOR:"},{"t":"FERGUS:","y":0.82383455538286032,"h":0.012214609924273701,"c":1,"w":0.050361490249633781,"x":0.084680846897442361},{"c":1,"w":0.043252595265706392,"t":"TUTOR:","x":0.086505190573605853,"y":0.85610465116394008,"h":0.010174418263205198},{"h":0.011892696458030372,"c":1,"x":0.083003331167406408,"w":0.051986417770385734,"t":"FERGUS:","y":0.87196062841959843},{"y":0.5041987403123892,"w":0.54671279907226555,"t":"Thanks for coming along, Nadia and Fergus. So this is a chance for you to give","h":0.016150096815895409,"x":0.16782007095820367,"c":1},{"h":0.017494751574527623,"y":0.5188943319761592,"c":1,"w":0.54671279907226566,"x":0.16782007516974942,"t":"us some feedback about different aspects of your course. What would you like"},{"t":"to begin with?","y":0.53738080918451192,"x":0.1676326396228664,"w":0.10426771799723306,"c":1,"h":0.014341955672117934},{"c":1,"y":0.55062789082107899,"x":0.16604769819107693,"w":0.56065638224283854,"t":"I've enjoyed the sessions on food safety. There was some information there that","h":0.018669157782328472},{"t":"I found really surprising, although some was stuff I knew already, like the rise in","x":0.16604615118421237,"y":0.56666565358771492,"w":0.55200841267903644,"h":0.019016339947411476,"c":1},{"x":0.16766596063835465,"h":0.014169774412524871,"y":0.58347341526809426,"w":0.11632995605468749,"c":1,"t":"rates of obesity."},{"h":0.015988371937820545,"y":0.60029069774927279,"c":1,"t":"Yeah, that's been in the news a lot. But I hadn't realised that unsafe food causes","x":0.16782006013297074,"w":0.55882354736328121},{"h":0.015827704844064372,"w":0.23549524943033856,"x":0.16773822132467814,"c":1,"t":"more than 200 different diseases.","y":0.61508915565663613},{"y":0.63226032174567226,"h":0.016095171448565426,"w":0.55363321940104171,"t":"No, I'd no idea it was that many. And speaking of diseases, I knew resistance to","x":0.16782006841283684,"c":1},{"w":0.37197232564290361,"h":0.015988371937820545,"c":1,"t":"antibiotics is on the increase, but I didn't know why...","x":0.16782006546437955,"y":0.64825581402688226},{"x":0.16782007803818497,"w":0.50173009236653643,"h":0.016095171448565426,"y":0.66270118973066794,"t":"...that it's partly because when animals are treated with antibiotics then","c":1},{"y":0.67877906968515944,"x":0.16782006859170556,"w":0.52941177368164061,"t":"consumed by humans, the antibiotics get into the food chain. I had no idea","h":0.016112463052161075,"c":1},{"t":"about that either.","y":0.69622093034482813,"x":0.16782006831623145,"w":0.12283737182617185,"h":0.013081395100512871,"c":1},{"c":1,"y":0.71063680895388182,"w":0.56055363972981775,"t":"Then the sessions provided a lot of information about plastic pollution from food","x":0.16782006589477741,"h":0.016107377011597479},{"w":0.54152247111002605,"h":0.016095171448565426,"c":1,"t":"packaging in the ocean, but I think that most of us were already aware of that.","y":0.72673198055412958,"x":0.16782007936976509},{"x":0.1678200671800793,"y":0.74273255821414219,"c":1,"h":0.015988371937820545,"w":0.52249135335286456,"t":"Yeah. But I thought we could have done more on how much food is thrown"},{"x":0.16782006855296325,"w":0.48442906697591148,"h":0.01759036259687885,"t":"away unnecessarily through fear of it being out of date, that was only","c":1,"y":0.7585724283750902},{"w":0.154520149230957,"t":"mentioned in passing.","c":1,"x":0.16933743076527161,"y":0.77343869090129735,"h":0.016055676384853168},{"h":0.016160268229650776,"c":1,"t":"OK, I'll bear that in mind. What did you think about the sessions from visiting","w":0.53633219401041665,"x":0.16782006207639966,"y":0.79069767449355011},{"w":0.12802768707275392,"t":"lecturers, Fergus?","c":1,"y":0.80668604657812615,"x":0.16608996260549153,"h":0.015988371937820434},{"x":0.16777389120485159,"y":0.82115797889774511,"h":0.018919474266057668,"w":0.54335601806640632,"c":1,"t":"For me the most interesting one was about that project to prevent companies"},{"t":"giving incorrect information to consumers about food.","y":0.83750007117603142,"c":1,"h":0.014435317651469659,"x":0.16948030239960835,"w":0.37383605957031252},{"t":"Ah, tood fraud, yes.","y":0.85465116285474962,"h":0.015988371937820434,"c":1,"w":0.14186851501464842,"x":0.16782006763489615},{"w":0.51903111775716149,"c":1,"h":0.016095171448565426,"y":0.86913925832649408,"x":0.16608997496224978,"t":"I thought it was really good to address a problem that's faced by so many"},{"y":0.88517441865941193,"c":1,"h":0.016155182189087181,"t":"different groups - people with special religious rules, as well as vegetarians and","w":0.56055363972981764,"x":0.1678200665562479},{"x":0.16950782843316858,"w":0.055448010762532557,"c":1,"h":0.010504166674497162,"t":"vegans.","y":0.90535838176205774},{"h":0.019321320856092949,"t":"And those with allergies.","x":0.16752082165944349,"y":0.91453466294759633,"w":0.17543754577636717,"c":1},{"y":0.92005813932441549,"w":0.043252595265706364,"t":"NADIA:","x":0.084775086367290989,"c":1,"h":0.011627907349230804},{"w":0.032871971130371089,"t":"104","y":0.95784883749852112,"x":0.084775087220281584,"h":0.014534882851794939,"c":1},{"x":0.74913494860917051,"h":0.01308139510051276,"c":1,"t":"Q15","w":0.032871971130371103,"y":0.13953488380875523},{"y":0.17877906972808666,"c":1,"x":0.74913494836647543,"t":"Q16","w":0.032871971130371103,"h":0.01308139510051276},{"y":0.23546511606052678,"h":0.011627907349230693,"t":"Q17","w":0.032871971130371103,"x":0.74913494860917051,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"Q18","y":0.30668604659731535,"x":0.74913494860436458,"w":0.032871971130371103,"h":0.013081395100512871},{"t":"Q19","x":0.74913494797093472,"c":1,"h":0.015988371937820434,"y":0.34447674422157326,"w":0.034602076212565058},{"x":0.7491349479663818,"y":0.41715116251751883,"w":0.034602076212565058,"h":0.014534884186538477,"c":1,"t":"Q20"},{"w":0.057127844492594337,"h":0.01463043447805501,"c":1,"x":0.74911773856979269,"y":0.59878943389939843,"t":"Q21\/22"},{"c":1,"t":"021\/22","y":0.66236717623733321,"x":0.74898003307695638,"w":0.060863463083903002,"h":0.016835414921177905},{"h":0.017444989662891208,"y":0.8684577377003887,"c":1,"t":"023\/24","w":0.061076933542887346,"x":0.74887329784879875}],"h":2857}